{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/553623-beast-character-fiction-extract","id":553623,"title":"Beast Character Fiction Extract","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-13T19:13:32-07:00","id":553623,"title":"Beast Character Fiction Extract","content":"I was writing a piece of fiction for a Beast character I wanted to try out. The new Introduction makes parts of it...shaky to say the least. So here is an extract of the most no longer relevant section of the incomplete draft. Added extra to provide context.<br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ ___________________<br /> <i>Dr. Herran had gone on a limb to check</i> <i>for a paranormal cause. Father were would not tolerate such so-called nonsense from her therapist, but Elsi knew this was not normal. She had the nightmares for years, almost never ending, only growing worse as time went on.</i> <i>There was a reason why she had asked Dr. Herran to check for any arcane significance; he was the one who took that to mean-<br /> <br /> &quot;Elsi?&quot;<br /> <br /> Her nerves </i><i>were writhing under her skin. It took a moment to look up at the kindly old Spaniard, to push aside her anxiety and focus on her latest hope to get these terrors under control. &quot;Yes Dr. Herran.&quot;<br /> <br /> A slight semblance of a smile</i> <i>crossed his face for a brief moment, before he remember what he had to say. &quot;Please, call me Pablo...I'm afraid I have some bad news.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It's not a curse, it is just normal nightmares and I am so far in denial about the underlining issues</i><i> that I can't recognize them?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Not exactly.<b> It is</b> supernatural in origin.</i> <i>Even that blizzard-&quot;<br /> <br /> If there was an alarm attached to Elsi, the siren would be whooping in overdrive mode. There were some aspects of the nightmares she never shared, the ones that made her feel comfortable. &quot;I never mentioned that! How did yo-&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<b>Elsi Vasa</b><b>!</b> This is important. I understand that there are some aspects that you did not want to share. It is natural to want to keep a part of ourselves private. You expressed concern that the night terrors were not mundane in origin. I used...alternative method to check; but that is not as important <b>what</b> I found.</i>..<i>Elsi, you weren't cursed with these nightmares.<br /> You were born with them.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 06-13-2015, 10:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T18:00:55-07:00","id":555074,"title":"","content":"You should probably wait for the rest of the revisions to come out before working on it any more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T20:58:23-07:00","id":555251,"title":"","content":"Need to see how the rest of the changes play out. &quot;Born with it&quot; could simply be the closest way to say it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T23:52:11-07:00","id":555364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gallus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/553623-beast-character-fiction-extract?p=555074#post555074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You should probably wait for the rest of the revisions to come out before working on it any more.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is what I am doing, just thought I'd share the bit that is less cannon now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}